    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">An IBA-approved consignment bilty is required to ensure that the bike is transported securely and safely.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>In addition to these documents, it's highly recommended to opt for 100% declared-value marine transit insurance. This type of insurance provides comprehensive coverage for the bike during transportation, giving you peace of mind and financial protection in case of any unforeseen events.</p>
<p>With 100% declared-value marine transit insurance, you can be assured that your bike is fully protected against any damages or losses, and you will receive the full declared value of the bike in case of any claims.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">By having these essential documents and opting for 100% declared-value marine transit insurance, you can ensure a safe and secure bike transportation experience in Balaghat.</p>
